<title>USA: Family Dollar sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Family Dollar sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS. N.C. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Dollar Stores Inc said Wednesday its board had set a three-for-two stock split, payable around July 31, record July 15.</p>
<p>After the split, shares outstanding will total 85.8 million, it said.</p>
</text>
